  "text": "设 $\\mathbb{R}$ 为实数的全体。求椭圆体 $$E = \\left\\{(x,y,z) \\in \\mathbb{R}^3 \\mid \\left(\\frac{x}{a}\\right)^2 + \\left(\\frac{y}{b}\\right)^2 + \\left(\\frac{z}{c}\\right)^2 \\leq 1\\right\\}$$的体积 $V$，其中 $a > 0, b > 0, c > 0$。",
  "knowledge_points": [
    "三重积分",
    "坐标变换",
    "雅可比行列式"
  ],
  "question_type": "计算题",
  "method": [
    "坐标变换法"
  ],
  "solution_steps": [
    "建立坐标变换",
    "计算雅可比行列式",
    "利用单位球体积"
  ],
  "math_structure": {
    "type": "ellipsoid_volume",
    "template": "$$V = \\frac{4\\pi abc}{3}$$",
    "variable_count": 3
  },
  "difficulty": 3,
  "answer": [
